    "\\bquestion mark\\b",
    "\\bpunctuation\\b",
    "\\bperiod\\b",
    "\\bexclamation mark\\b",
    "\\bexclamation point\\b"
  ],
  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Short stems of four to six words. Clear end marks. Statements tell. Questions start with who, what, where, when, or why. Commands start with a verb. Exclamations are short and end with an exclamation mark.",
    "2": "Grade-level stems of five to eight words. Use two-syllable kid words. Questions may start with can, did, does, or will. Commands may start with please.",
    "3": "Near misses. Statements that hold what, where, or how. Exclamations that start with what or how. Longer yes or no questions. Never two readings."
  },
